{"Title":"An Act relative to establishing an office of partnership coordination within the department of conservation and recreation","BillNumber":"S569","DocketNumber":"SD1804","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"RLR0","Name":"Rebecca L. Rausch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RLR0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T23:10:35.793"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"RLR0","Name":"Rebecca L. Rausch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RLR0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T23:10:35.7933333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S569/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Ms. Rausch, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 569) of Rebecca L. Rausch for legislation to establish an office of partnership coordination within the department of conservation and recreation.  Environment and Natural Resources.","DocumentText":"\tSection 1 of chapter 21 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting at the end thereof the following paragraph:- \r\n\tThe department of conservation and recreation shall establish an office of partnership coordination for the purpose of maintaining and strengthening relations between the department, park friends groups, and public-private partnerships to support state parks.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J21","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J21"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}